        <technology>
            <technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses xml:lang="en">Based on ASTRA 21001, Fachhandbuch Trassee/Umwelt (FHB T/U), Lärmschutzwand Freifeld, Betonrippenplatte (ASTRA). Dimensions based on scaled measurement using known reference values.\n\n# Included processes\n1 meter of noise barrier wall installed along the roadside in open terrain.\nTotal visible height: 3.2 meters, consisting of a ribbed concrete panel with a height of 3.0 meters.\nThe system boundary includes deconstruction phase (C1), transport phase (C2), treatment/ recycling phase (C3), and final disposal phase (C4) for for one meter of installed noise barrier wall, including excavation, backfilling, and foundation works.</technologyDescriptionAndIncludedProcesses>
